{"The cleanup registration inside the loop uses a hardcoded \"alias\" string instead of the actual identity provider alias, so the created providers are never removed by the test cleanup and can pollute the test realm or cause unexpected failures in subsequent tests": 0.9314089417457581, "When removing an identity provider by alias, if the alias does not exist, storedIdp will be null and both registerIDPInvalidation(storedIdp) and registerIDPLoginInvalidation(storedIdp) will throw a NullPointerException, causing the remove operation to fail instead of safely returning false": 0.7988036870956421}